Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好噁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好惡是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.45,0:01:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是對待女朋友的態度嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你別裝著很拽的樣子好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前一直被你欺負得很慘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在要報復囉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼報復啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個女生…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是住在大谷隔壁的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是美美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:11.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你女朋友真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 要遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.95,0:02:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪你拖拖拉拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.95,0:02:18.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你在犯傻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:20.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 再見啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宣戰通告！！醋意燃燒的危險美少女！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼不告訴我們 幹嘛都保密啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.06,0:02:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼時候的事？他是怎麼跟你求婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊 恭喜恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.53,0:02:38.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學長 是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真讓人感動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這對活寶搭檔終於成為情侶了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:50.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝大家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也太小題大做了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:57.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 理莎 為什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再考慮一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟這樣的傢伙在一起很奇怪欸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼叫這樣的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:06.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你給我閉嘴 微型人 少得意忘形
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就知道 這一天遲早會來的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 剛剛老師在找你們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經結束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:39.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暑假補習的作業忘記了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了這種時候 再下點功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下週一之前給我交出來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:03:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然完全忘記了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們分工合作吧 作業
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪做？跟鈴木他們去圖書館嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:12.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一到圖書館那種寂靜的地方 就會有快要窒息的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的確會有窒息的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼到我家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回來啦 敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟女朋友一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:36.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把今天的牛奶帶來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.39,0:04:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牛奶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這傢伙說要讓我長高每天都送牛奶過來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:47.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的牛奶很棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:51.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是從北海道直接運來的高鈣鮮奶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為…牛奶…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:03.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你沒其他事了吧 那就趕緊回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美想跟敦敦的女朋友說說話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我們要學習了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事啦大谷 就一會
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:20.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一小會哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦 下來一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事啊 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:38.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美看起來好修長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多高啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:41.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,172公分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 跟我一樣哎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是敦敦一直說她討厭比他高的人欸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過他好像不介意我的身高 不知道為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 敦敦以前的女朋友是個很嬌小的女生 你知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既嬌小又可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以美美才對敦敦死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:18.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 你喜歡大谷？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.81,0:06:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是敦敦喜歡嬌小的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:24.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美卻長得這麼高
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以為了讓敦敦長高 就每天給他送牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:31.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這…這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我決定等哪天敦敦比我高了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要做敦敦的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:40.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個…那個…真對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒戳到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:55.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起？你以為你是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底對敦敦使了什麼卑鄙的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想被我用烏龍麵穿鼻打結是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.59,0:07:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦怎麼可能要你這種女人當女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美美…美
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要用你那噁心吧啦的嘴叫我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是再敢接近敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就讓你下半輩子求生不得 求死不能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,茶點來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛋糕蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美要吃芒果凍 可以嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請用…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 敦敦的女朋友好溫柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛才那個是幻覺？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:54.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒…沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是幻覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.77,0:08:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那是什麼表情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 吃完這個就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到她是模特兒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷的鄰居看起來很厲害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是美美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.03,0:08:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟大谷說也沒用的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 也不用太介意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:54.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作業都交了 一起去玩玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:08:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管被別人說了什麼或做了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:01.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有大谷的愛 我就很幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美想多了解一下的敦敦的女朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天約好了一起出去玩 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:23.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧好吧 那你們兩個一起回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不像在兩個女巨人的包圍下回家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就成了被挾持的外星人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我扁你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:33.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.41,0:09:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…等一下 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老太婆 你搞清楚狀況了沒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我過來談談
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.75,0:09:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會變成這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直盯著我看…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你這樣的傢伙是怎麼跟敦敦交往起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:10.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非常努力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:15.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 我也非常非常努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在敦敦面前 美美表現得很可愛對不對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:24.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自從懂事起 美美就一直這樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這有多辛苦你知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那真是太辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還不只是那樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為了讓敦敦長高 我天天給他送牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:37.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是他從初一開始就一點都沒長高
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是與之相反的是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美小學畢業的時候就已經170公分了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我小學六年級的時候也有168公分了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.30,0:10:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人 真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 從幼兒園開始 每次排隊一定是最後一個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:57.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美也是 美美也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美比班裡最高的男生還要高呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是啊 真的很討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什麼都很引人注意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 稍微說句話就被老師抓到……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰跟你在這裡話當年啊 你這白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 偏題了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:23.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以當那個嬌小可愛的女生成為敦敦的女朋友後
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:25.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美也就死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我們這種身高比都沒辦法比
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:30.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:34.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個女孩真的不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本來還以為是個心機很重的黑心女呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 跟美美完全不一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:40.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對啊對啊 美美就是個黑心女…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:42.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真多嘴 給我閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰黑心啊 豬頭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對…對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易等到他跟那個女孩分手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到下一個居然是你這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人高馬大又白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:55.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 美美絕不會輸給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定會搶回敦敦的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要說的就這些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對…對不起 能不能借我點錢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只帶了50元
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有50元還敢進餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是敗給你的勇氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了我早上買了雜誌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為美美實在太可愛 就忍不住買下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:34.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真拿你沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:36.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只此一次 我就破例借給你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:39.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 你人真好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把錢包忘在學校了 怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,630日元
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們是存心的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜歡她哪點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.15,0:13:13.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼突然提這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為她和你之前的女朋友類型完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又比你高
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只帶50元還敢進餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我實在不懂 她到底哪裡好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裡不是說這話的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說吧 美美想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了吧 這跟美美你沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然有關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美比她更喜歡敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是在開玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦你這個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:02.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:03.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為 我完全明白美美的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦他說了什麼沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他生美美的氣了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:48.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有…他沒生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:54.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是美美一時衝動罵了敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦你這個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這事不必在意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷他本來就是個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難得有人告白 這個白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.71,0:15:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦才不是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.15,0:15:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然被告白誰都會嚇一跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是美美不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:18.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准說敦敦的壞話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:26.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本來不想在這種情況下告白的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不該一時衝動 突然這樣告白的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪你這個混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你這混蛋把美美的人生搞得一團糟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底要怎麼賠償我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:48.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別不說話 你說說看你想怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真想就這樣掐死你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美…美？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定很沮喪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然在大谷面前本性畢露
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:11.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎麼回事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道平常跟我在一起的美美都是裝出來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:19.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在喜歡的人面前當然想裝可愛囉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:21.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真噁心真噁心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噁心是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.97,0:16:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧 又來了 你這樣哪裡可愛了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:28.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還不是你嘴賤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別說這個了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.11,0:16:33.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美有聯繫過你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個啊 她有說今天放學三個人一起去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為…為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:43.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美已經豁出去了 決定玩真的了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.43,0:16:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩真的是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼可愛的女生要玩真的的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷這個笨蛋會不會……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我絕不會輸的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會讓至今的努力都白費的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們就去敦敦想去的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你們等…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:23.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你們了 離我遠一點好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩哪個玩哪個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:37.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個空著呢 我們過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:38.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:17:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 美美呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美也來玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有話必須要跟你說清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要聽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:29.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想拒絕我是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要聽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:41.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要聽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 你聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我不想聽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我對小泉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:53.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:54.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住口！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.31,0:18:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我！…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:18:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是說比我更喜歡大谷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是嘴上說說而已嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身為女朋友的你怎麼會明白被拒絕的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:14.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾被拒絕過兩次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也曾想過放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:20.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我還是沒辦法死心 所以一直都在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然說現在是他的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:28.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他還是會罵我白痴豬頭噁心什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:31.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看他那樣子 誰知道是不是真心喜歡我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 因為我太喜歡他了 所以不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不會把大谷交給害怕拒絕選擇逃避的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個…美美回去的時候還很生氣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:05.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說是沒辦法變成像你這樣的白痴 所以對我死心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一開始被敦敦拒絕的時候 一定非常痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是卻一直努力直到敦敦回應她
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.16,0:20:39.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你剛剛都說了些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.77,0:20:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼不明白是不是真心喜歡之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:46.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一時衝動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:00.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還特地站在高處
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然就沒這麼帥了不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.49,0:21:16.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然發生了很多事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望兩個人就這樣在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直到永遠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:28.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在出試卷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:32.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 是之前發下去的志願表
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經到了要做最後決定的時刻了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,ALL阪神 巨人終於也要解散啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,預告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起上大學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟大谷分開的話以後會怎樣呢
